        "variant": "guest-progression-quests",
        "html": "<div class=\"progression-page\" data-progression-page=\"quests\" data-companion-context=\"feast-pass-quests\" data-companion-copy=\"The quest board lists only activities with a website-local event source.\">\n  <nav class=\"detail-breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"/\">Home</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><a href=\"/feast-pass/\">Feast Pass</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>Quests</span></nav>\n  <header class=\"progression-hero\"><p class=\"section-kicker\">TOADAL FEAST &middot; GUEST JOURNEY</p><p class=\"progression-eyebrow\">QUEST BOARD</p><h1>Quests &amp; challenges</h1><p class=\"progression-lede\">Progress comes from real, configured website activity. Definitions and browser-local quest state are separate. Starter XP and Sparks are editable settings.</p><p class=\"progression-truth-note\">Quest rewards are local XP/Sparks markers only; they create no entitlement or transfer. No server rotations, weekly timers, dates, published story completion, or simulated opponents are used.</p></header>\n  <section class=\"progression-section\" aria-labelledby=\"quests-status-title\"><div class=\"progression-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"section-kicker\">YOUR LOCAL STATUS</p><h2 id=\"quests-status-title\">Quest progress</h2></div><span class=\"progression-local-badge\">Guest &middot; this browser</span></div><p class=\"progression-storage\" data-progression-storage-status role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\">Guest progress is stored only in this browser.</p></section>\n  <section class=\"progression-section\" id=\"daily-quests\" aria-labelledby=\"daily-quests-title\"><div class=\"progression-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"section-kicker\">UTC DAY</p><h2 id=\"daily-quests-title\">Daily</h2></div></div><p>Daily check-in is available on the <a href=\"/feast-pass/\">Feast Pass</a>. It uses the current UTC day and editable starter values; no separate daily quest rotation is configured.</p></section>\n  <section class=\"progression-section\" id=\"weekly-quests\" aria-labelledby=\"weekly-quests-title\"><div class=\"progression-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"section-kicker\">NO ROTATION</p><h2 id=\"weekly-quests-title\">Weekly</h2></div></div><p>No weekly quests are configured. There is no hidden timer or server schedule.</p></section>\n  <section class=\"progression-section\" id=\"exploration-quests\" aria-labelledby=\"exploration-quests-title\"><div class=\"progression-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"section-kicker\">EXPLORE</p><h2 id=\"exploration-quests-title\">Exploration</h2></div></div><h3>Active</h3><div class=\"progression-empty\" data-progression-quest-list=\"active\" data-quest-category=\"exploration\" data-progression-empty=\"No active exploration quests. Visit the World or collect a Home Treat to start one.\"></div><h3>Completed</h3><div class=\"progression-empty\" data-progression-quest-list=\"completed\" data-quest-category=\"exploration\" data-progression-empty=\"No exploration quests completed yet.\"></div></section>\n  <section class=\"progression-section\" id=\"game-quests\" aria-labelledby=\"game-quests-title\"><div class=\"progression-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"section-kicker\">BROWSER PREVIEW</p><h2 id=\"game-quests-title\">Game</h2></div></div><h3>Active</h3><div class=\"progression-empty\" data-progression-quest-list=\"active\" data-quest-category=\"game\" data-progression-empty=\"No game quests are active yet.\"></div><h3>Completed</h3><div class=\"progression-empty\" data-progression-quest-list=\"completed\" data-quest-category=\"game\" data-progression-empty=\"No browser preview completions recorded yet.\"></div><p>Only a validated website-player completion with a valid score can advance a game quest.</p></section>\n  <section class=\"progression-section\" id=\"story-quests\" aria-labelledby=\"story-quests-title\"><div class=\"progression-section-heading\"><div><p class=\"section-kicker\">STORIES</p><h2 id=\"story-quests-title\">Story</h2></div></div><h3>Active</h3><div class=\"progression-empty\" data-progression-quest-list=\"active\" data-quest-category=\"story\" data-progression-empty=\"No story-page visit quests are active.\"></div><h3>Completed</h3><div class=\"progression-empty\" data-progression-quest-list=\"completed\" data-quest-category=\"story\" data-progression-empty=\"No story-page visit quests completed yet.\"></div><p>A Stories page visit is website activity only; it is not published story completion.</p></section>\n  <nav class=\"progression-nav\" aria-label=\"Player pages\"><a href=\"/feast-pass/\">Feast Pass</a><a href=\"/feast-pass/quests/\" aria-current=\"page\">Quests <span class=\"sr-only\">(current page)</span></a><a href=\"/feast-pass/rewards/\">Rewards</a><a href=\"/leaderboards/\">Leaderboards</a><a href=\"/profile/\">Guest profile</a></nav>\n  <section class=\"progression-controls\" aria-labelledby=\"quest-controls-title\"><div><h2 id=\"quest-controls-title\">Local data controls</h2><p>Clearing removes website progression only. Unrelated game and mobile data are not affected.</p></div><button class=\"button-link button-link--secondary\" type=\"button\" data-clear-progression>Clear website progression</button></section>\n</div>"
